  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Education &amp; Empowerment for the refugees of Lesvos</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Mosaik Support Center is a place that aims to provide a sustainable solution and to give refugees the tools they need to integrate into the local society and in Europe. Mosaik is a place of meeting, exchanging ideas and evolving, open to all. A variety of courses, an open library, cultural and environmental awareness events, all take place in a beautiful building that embodies solidarity and multiculturalism. English, Arabic, Greek and IT courses are currently offered to everyone for free.</narrative>
  </description>
